	// While in the presence of...
	//
	// ⚠️ THE MINION FORMS NEED THEIR OWN ROWS AND THE SHORTER PREFIX BELOW DOES NOT COVER THEM.
	// One prefix is consumed per line, so on "While a Unique Enemy is in your Presence, Minions
	// deal 31% increased Damage" the short row ate its half and the remaining "minions deal ..."
	// reached no second prefix scan -- the whole line was discarded, on 28 corpus builds. PoB
	// carries both the long and short rows (:1132-1133 and :1314-1315) for exactly this reason,
	// and the longest match wins on both sides.
	`^while a unique enemy is in your presence, minions [hd][ae][va][el] `:        {addToMinion: true, playerTag: mod.ActorCondition("enemy", "RareOrUnique")},
	`^while a pinnacle atlas boss is in your presence, minions [hd][ae][va][el] `: {addToMinion: true, playerTag: mod.ActorCondition("enemy", "PinnacleBoss")},
