	// ModParser.lua:1001 stamps ModFlag.Dot here, it does NOT add a condition. The condition
	// belongs to the CONFIG path (configs.go:2030, PoB's CalcSetup.lua:576); emitting it here as
	// well meant a "+X% to Chaos Resistance against Damage over Time" line produced an unflagged
	// conditional mod, which CalcDefence.lua:589's Dot-flagged dotBase sum can never see.
	`against damage over time`:                                                         {flags: mod.MFlagDot},
