	`against enemies that are on low life`:  {tag: mod.ActorCondition("enemy", "LowLife")},
	// ⚠️ THE NEGATED FORMS EXIST UPSTREAM AND WERE MISSING, AND THE WHOLE LINE WAS LOST.
	// Assassin's "Knife in the Back" (tree node 21264) reads "100% more Critical Strike Chance
	// against Enemies that are not on Low Life". Without these rows the phrase left an unparsed
