	// ⚠️ THE FLAG WAS MFlagAttack AND THE PIN SETS ModFlag.Hit. ModParser.lua:2499 is
	// `bor(ModFlag.Hit, ModFlag.Projectile)`; Hit is 0x4 and Attack is 0x1, and the two bit tables
	// were compared entry by entry (Global.lua:103-111 against mod/mod.go:33-35) before this was
