	// AILMENTS", keywordFlags Hit|Ailment, no ModFlag — while the row directly above is :2499,
	// "increased … with hits TO TARGETS", ModFlag Hit|Projectile, no keywordFlags. Different
	// modifier type, different flag KIND, different text. Read the PIN LINE a hit corresponds to,
	// not just the phrase.
	//
	// This is Deadeye's Far Shot (Tree:45313), 295 corpus builds and the largest F-rung cluster:
	// at projectileDistance 40 it is 30 * (40-35)/(70-35) = 4.286% more, and 1/1.04286 = 0.95890,
