	// ModParser.lua:3790. ⚠️ PARTIALLY PORTED FAMILY: the freeze entry and the three-flag
	// non-damaging-ailment entry are both here and the IGNITE one was not, so "Critical Strikes
	// do not inherently Ignite" was dropped WHOLE on 81 corpus builds and IgniteChanceOnCrit
	// stayed at 100 where PoB sets it to IgniteChanceOnHit. The consumer already existed --
	// calc_offence.go:3583 tests CritsDontAlways<Ailment> generically for every ailment.
