	// ModParser.lua:4095-4101 and :4034. calc_defence.go has carried the whole luck-roll
	// consumer since the Effective*BlockChance family landed, with a comment recording that the
	// branches were INERT because nothing in this tree produced these names. These are the
	// producers. Sized on PoB's side over the 2300 dumps -- never on ours, since an instrument
	// counting our own artifacts reports 0 for anything we drop: 228 builds, 676 pairs where
	// PoB's Effective*BlockChance differs from the raw chance.
	`y?o?u?r? ?chance to block is lucky`: []mod.Mod{
		mod.NewFlag("BlockChanceIsLucky", true), mod.NewFlag("ProjectileBlockChanceIsLucky", true),
