	// ModParser.lua:2878, :4992, :4993, :4994 — the ally-redirect family. Each names an ally whose
	// Life is spent before yours; CalcDefence.lua:2458-2474 turns the sum into that ally's
	// mitigation and CalcDefence.lua:3147/:263 spend it. `takenFromMinionBeforeYou` and
	// `takenFromVaalRejuvenationTotemsBeforeYou` already reach us through the generated skill stat
	// map and are deliberately not repeated here.
	//
	// ⚠️ THE TAGS ARE NOT DECORATION. The totem row is gated on HaveTotem — without it a build with
	// the modifier and no totem redirects damage into a pool that does not exist — and the void
	// spawn row scales per spawn, so a flat port would grant one spawn's worth to a full swarm.
	`(\d+)% of damage from hits is taken from your sentinel of radiance's life before you`: func(num float64, captures []string) ([]mod.Mod, string) {
		return []mod.Mod{MOD("takenFromRadianceSentinelBeforeYou", "BASE", num)}, ""
	},
