	// ACTORS AND THAT IS THE ONLY DIFFERENCE BETWEEN THEM: Shaper's Presence is an ExtraAura on the
	// PLAYER, Maddening Presence an EnemyModifier on the ENEMY. Writing both as EnemyModifier
	// because they read alike would put a -10% Damage on the enemy AND take the buff off the
	// player, and the corpus fixture only grades the enemy side.
