	// Additional trap & mine throw — ModParser.lua:4348-4356. ⚠️ The chance forms multiply the
	// COUNT by the CHANCE and file the product as a plain BASE, which is why PoB's own
	// TrapThrowCount is fractional (1.24, 1.59, 1.83) rather than an integer with a chance tag.
