	// ⚠️ ModParser.lua:4865-4866 (`immune to bleeding/poison if equipped helmet has higher
	// armour/evasion...`) ARE NOT PORTED: their `HelmetArmourHigherThanEvasion` and
	// `HelmetEvasionHigherThanArmour` conditions have NO producer in this tree, so both ends are
	// absent and either half alone measures exactly zero. Unlike the MultiplierThreshold trap at
	// :3060 the failure here is INERT rather than an over-application — an unset Condition is
