	// ⚠️ THE PRODUCER HALF OF A PAIR WHOSE CONSUMER HAS BEEN INERT. calc_offence.go:2257 reads
	// `Flag(cfg, "DealNo"+type, "DealNoDamage")` and nothing in this tree produced the blanket
	// name, so the consumer was correct and worth exactly zero — both ends absent is the one
	// arrangement where a half-fix is invisible. 307 of 8648 PoB dumps carry it.
	// TestProducerlessConsumersAreStillProducerless pinned that state; its DealNoDamage row goes
	// in the same commit as this one.
	//
	// ⚠️ PoB SETS `includeTransfigured = true` ON THIS TAG AND mod.SkillNameTag CANNOT EXPRESS IT.
	// Without it the flag reaches the three base mines and not their transfigured variants, so a
	// build running e.g. "Pyroclast Mine of Sabotage" deals damage PoB zeroes — an OVER-application,
	// the direction no missing-thing instrument looks. Declared rather than silently narrowed:
	// adding the field means a SkillNameTag option plus the gameId-normalising compare
	// ModStore.lua:764 does, which is a change to moddb's matching and not to this row.
	// The condition that retires this: `mod.SkillNameTag` gaining an IncludeTransfigured field.
	//
