	// ⚠️ THIS WAS FILED AS A TREE DEFECT FOR FOUR ROUNDS AND IT IS A PARSER GAP.
	// `Tree:UniqueNotableInt1` is the SOURCE string PoB builds at CalcSetup.lua:164 as
